art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_termo_7 a art:OcorrenciaTermo ;
    art:doTermo art:termo_train ;
    art:frequencia 38 ;
    art:posicaoRanking 7 .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_termo_8 a art:OcorrenciaTermo ;
    art:doTermo art:termo_document ;
    art:frequencia 28 ;
    art:posicaoRanking 8 .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_termo_9 a art:OcorrenciaTermo ;
    art:doTermo art:termo_pretrained ;
    art:frequencia 27 ;
    art:posicaoRanking 9 .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_trabalho_futuro_1 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_secao_9 ;
    art:pontuacao 7 ;
    art:texto "It would be interesting to initialize our model weights from more recent Transformer models to investigate if additional gains are possible."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_trabalho_futuro_2 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_secao_9 ;
    art:pontuacao 10 ;
    art:texto "Another item of future work is to develop better multitask approaches to leverage multiple signals of relatedness information during training."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_trabalho_futuro_3 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_207_secao_9 ;
    art:pontuacao 10 ;
    art:texto "Including other information such as outgoing citations as additional input to the model would be yet another area to explore in future."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_metodo_1 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "In S2ORC, we aggregate papers from hundreds of academic publishers and digital archives into a unified source, and create the largest publicly-available collection of machine-readable academic text to date."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_metodo_2 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "We then evaluate a BERT model pretrained on S2ORC (§5), and discuss potential applications to a variety of NLP and analysis tasks over academic text (§6)."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_metodo_3 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_secao_3 ;
    art:pontuacao 3 ;
    art:texto "The output of this pipeline is visualized in Figure 1."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_objetivo_1 a art:Objetivo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "We introduce S2ORC, 1 a large corpus of 81.1M English-language academic papers spanning many academic disciplines."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_objetivo_2 a art:Objetivo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "In this paper, we describe the construction of S2ORC (§2)."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_problema_1 a art:Problema ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 6 ;
    art:texto "Yet, existing corpora are not without their limitations."@en .

art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_problema_2 a art:Problema ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_2020_acl_main_447_secao_3 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "Although these papers that lack text may be useful as cite-able nodes in S2ORC, they are generally of lower quality and are filtered out of the corpus to improve corpus quality."@en .

