art:artigo_P14_1059_trabalho_futuro_1 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_P14_1059_secao_6 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "In future work we will exploit the correlation between confidence and quality for the purpose of eliminating this assumption."@en .

art:artigo_P14_1059_trabalho_futuro_2 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_P14_1059_secao_9 ;
    art:pontuacao 8 ;
    art:texto "For future work we would like to experiment with more complex models for (de-)composition in order to improve the performance on the tasks we used in this paper."@en .

art:artigo_P14_1059_trabalho_futuro_3 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_P14_1059_secao_9 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "Following this, we would like to extend the framework to handle arbitrary phrases, including making (confidencebased) choices on the syntactic structure of the phrase to be generated, which we have assumed to be given throughout this paper."@en .

art:artigo_bohnet09_metodo_1 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bohnet09_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "Our system combines and implements efficient parsing techniques to get a high accuracy as well as very good parsing and training time."@en .

art:artigo_bohnet09_metodo_2 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bohnet09_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "Our system uses the first approach since we saw better chance to improve the parsing speed and additionally, the MST had so far slightly better parsing results."@en .

art:artigo_bohnet09_metodo_3 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bohnet09_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "For the task of semantic role labeling, we adopted a pipeline architecture where we used for each step the same learning technique (SVM) since we opted for the possibility to build a synchronous combined parser with one score function."@en .

art:artigo_bohnet09_objetivo_1 a art:Objetivo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bohnet09_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "In this paper, we describe our system for the 2009 CoNLL shared task for joint parsing of syntactic and semantic dependency structures of multiple languages."@en .

