art:artigo_bohnet09_trabalho_futuro_1 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bohnet09_secao_10 ;
    art:pontuacao 3 ;
    art:texto "Therefore, a possible further accuracy and parsing speed improvement would be to select different features sets for different languages or to leave out some features."@en .

art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_metodo_1 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "We extend an existing relation extraction method to handle this weaker form of supervision, and present experimental results demonstrating that our approach can reliably extract relations from web documents."@en .

art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_metodo_2 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "We have extended an existing approach to relation extraction using support vector machines and string kernels (Bunescu and Mooney, 2006) to handle this weaker form of MIL supervision."@en .

art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_metodo_3 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_secao_9 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "We have extended an existing relation extraction kernel to learn in this setting and to resolve problems caused by the minimal supervision provided."@en .

art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_objetivo_1 a art:Objetivo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "We present a new approach to relation extraction that requires only a handful of training examples."@en .

art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_objetivo_2 a art:Objetivo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "In this paper, we introduce a supervised learning approach to RE that requires only a handful of training examples and uses the web as a corpus."@en .

art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_problema_1 a art:Problema ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "Supervised learning has been shown to be effective for RE (Zelenko et al., 2003; Culotta and Sorensen, 2004; Bunescu and Mooney, 2006); however, annotating large corpora with examples of the relations to be extracted is expensive and tedious."@en .

art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_problema_2 a art:Problema ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_bunescu_acl07_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "Although not all of the sentences for positive pairs will state the desired relationship, many of them will."@en .

