art:artigo_fader11_trabalho_futuro_1 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_fader11_secao_7 ;
    art:pontuacao 13 ;
    art:texto "In future work, we plan to explore utilizing our constraints to improve the performance of learned CRF models."@en .

art:artigo_fader11_trabalho_futuro_2 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_fader11_secao_7 ;
    art:pontuacao 7 ;
    art:texto "The error analysis in Section 5.2 also suggests natural directions for future work."@en .

art:artigo_mooney05_metodo_1 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_mooney05_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "We evaluate the system in two domains, a natural-language database interface and an interpreter for coaching instructions in robotic soccer."@en .

art:artigo_mooney05_metodo_2 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_mooney05_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 6 ;
    art:texto "We present an approach based on a statistical parser that generates a semantically augmented parse tree (SAPT), in which each internal node includes both a syntactic and semantic label."@en .

art:artigo_mooney05_metodo_3 a art:Metodo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_mooney05_secao_2 ;
    art:pontuacao 4 ;
    art:texto "We augment Collins' head-driven model 2 (Collins, 1997) to incorporate a semantic label on each internal node."@en .

art:artigo_mooney05_objetivo_1 a art:Objetivo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_mooney05_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "We introduce a learning semantic parser, SCISSOR , that maps natural-language sentences to a detailed, formal, meaningrepresentation language."@en .

art:artigo_mooney05_objetivo_2 a art:Objetivo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_mooney05_secao_1 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "We present experimental results demonstrating that SCISSOR produces more accurate semantic representations than several previous approaches."@en .

