art:artigo_roark13_trabalho_futuro_1 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_roark13_secao_8 ;
    art:pontuacao 14 ;
    art:texto "In future work, we would like to investigate two questions left open by these results."@en .

art:artigo_roark13_trabalho_futuro_2 a art:TrabalhoFuturo ;
    art:extraidoDe art:artigo_roark13_secao_8 ;
    art:pontuacao 5 ;
    art:texto "First, word-alignment models can be extended to process ASR lattices or word confusion networks as part of the unsupervised alignment learning algorithm, and incorporated into our approach."@en .

